	17 JAN 2024:
	Now correctly reading particle potential, 'nmetal' metals, and initial particle mass. Particle tracer pointer has been added BUT NOT YET TESTED!
	18 JAN 2024:
	Added check about nvar_min == nmetals
	May not be appropriate if other passive variables are included, e.g. a colour tracer.

Notes:

	- GAS MASS AND CELL NUMBER INCREASES slightly at restart, presumably because IG_rho > 0 (however small) -> TO BE FIXED

About:

A merge of my dice_restart patch and the oagertz/dice patch.

Usage:

Need to set the following:

&RESTART_PARAMS
nrestart2=2			! restart snasphto
restart_vars=6,7   	!-> this is mandatory and needs to corresponds to the actual indices of passive scalars (excluding temperature)
/

&INIT_PARAMS
filetype='ramses'
/

&RUN_PARAMS
nrestart=0
/
